{"repo_path": "platform/tools/apksig", "commit_hash": "41d882324288085fd32ae0bb70dc85f5fd0e2be7", "author_name": "Michael Groover", "author_email": "mpgroover@google.com", "commit_time": "Fri Mar 31 14:30:21 2023 -0500", "commit_message": "Limit the number of supported v1 and v2 signers\n\nThe v1 and v2 APK Signature Schemes support multiple signers; this\nwas intended to allow multiple entities to sign an APK. Previously,\nthere were no limits placed on the number of signers that could\nsign an APK, but this commit sets a hard limit of 10 supported\nsigners for these signature schemes to ensure a large number of\nsigners does not place undue burden on the platform.\n\nBug: 266580022\nTest: gradlew test\n(cherry picked from https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:6be64b9339c1dad28abf75b53d3866fd42f320d6)\nMerged-In: I4fd8f603385dd7e59c81695a75fe6df9a116185d\nChange-Id: I4fd8f603385dd7e59c81695a75fe6df9a116185d", "changed_files": [{"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/ApkVerifier.java", "new_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/ApkVerifier.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/Constants.java", "new_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/Constants.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/internal/apk/v1/V1SchemeSigner.java", "new_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/internal/apk/v1/V1SchemeSigner.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/internal/apk/v1/V1SchemeVerifier.java", "new_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/internal/apk/v1/V1SchemeVerifier.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/internal/apk/v2/V2SchemeSigner.java", "new_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/internal/apk/v2/V2SchemeSigner.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/internal/apk/v2/V2SchemeVerifier.java", "new_path": "src/main/java/com/android/apksig/internal/apk/v2/V2SchemeVerifier.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/test/java/com/android/apksig/ApkSignerTest.java", "new_path": "src/test/java/com/android/apksig/ApkSignerTest.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/test/java/com/android/apksig/ApkVerifierTest.java", "new_path": "src/test/java/com/android/apksig/ApkVerifierTest.java"}, {"type": "add", "old_path": "/dev/null", "new_path": "src/test/resources/com/android/apksig/v1-only-10-signers.apk"}, {"type": "add", "old_path": "/dev/null", "new_path": "src/test/resources/com/android/apksig/v1-only-11-signers.apk"}, {"type": "add", "old_path": "/dev/null", "new_path": "src/test/resources/com/android/apksig/v2-only-10-signers.apk"}, {"type": "add", "old_path": "/dev/null", "new_path": "src/test/resources/com/android/apksig/v2-only-11-signers.apk"}]}